{"reference":"Isaiah 34","book":"Isaiah","chapter":34,"status":"pending","sections":[{"kind":"surrounding_passages","title":"Isaiah’s Textual Witnesses","blocks":[{"id":"block_1","text":"Isaiah 34 belongs to a book preserved in the Great Isaiah Scroll, an almost complete witness to all sixty-six chapters. It broadly aligns with the Masoretic tradition while also containing many spelling and substantive differences; other Qumran Isaiah manuscripts and interpretive writings likewise reflect active transmission and interpretation of Isaiah. This describes the book’s wider textual history, not a conclusion about a particular reading in this chapter.","provenance_refs":["reader_path_isaiah_034_f2d2802f308f66c30b798786"],"confidence":"high","interpretation_level":"disputed"}]}],"generated_metadata":null}